  "description": "<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background: white; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Adobe Hebrew', serif; color: black;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&bull;</span> We present original works painted by artist Tina Shenk: large and medium size paintings.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background: white; font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-align: start; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Adobe Hebrew', serif; color: black;\">All pictures made on professional canvas with oil paints.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background: white; font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-align: start; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Adobe Hebrew', serif; color: black;\">There is a section with paintings in stock that are ready to be sent, as well as paintings for pre-ordering. (processing time 1-2 weeks)&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background: white; font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-align: start; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; min-height: 22px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Adobe Hebrew', serif; color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background: white; font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-align: start; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; min-height: 22px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Adobe Hebrew', serif; color: black;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&bull;</span>Shipping is free and carried out from Poland all over the world by standard delivery that takes 2-4 weeks.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background: white; font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-align: start; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Adobe Hebrew', serif; color: black;\">Medium sizes ready for hang with the option of adding a frame.&nbsp;&nbsp;large sizes shipping only rolled in tube</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Adobe Hebrew', serif; color: black;\">&nbsp;by UPS that takes 3- 7 days.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background: white; font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-align: start; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; min-height: 22px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Adobe Hebrew', serif; color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background: white; font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-align: start; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Adobe Hebrew', serif; color: black;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&bull;</span>Brand also has a customer loyalty club.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; background: white; font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-align: start; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Adobe Hebrew', serif; color: black;